#: src/pirwa-boxes-dialog.c:237
msgid ""
"Pirwa copies the disk and UEFI firmware state into its own storage. Allow "
"enough free space for a separate disk copy; large disks can take a while. "
"You can cancel the copy.\n"
"\n"
"The imported machine appears stopped in Session and works without Boxes. "
"Select Start to check it. The original machine and its files stay in Boxes; "
"remove them there only after checking the imported copy. Installation media "
"is ejected from the copy.\n"
"\n"
"Import currently supports one standalone qcow2 disk. Machines with "
"snapshots, saved memory, backing chains, TPM, shared folders or passthrough "
"devices are not supported."
msgstr ""

